HST Office: the View tabs' Zoom groups show large labelled buttons where the reference suite does (gap list G10).

Writer: Zoom and 100% large (Optimal goes small); Sheets: Zoom, 100% and Zoom to Selection large (Full Screen and
Whole Page small); Slides and Draw: Fit to Window (Whole Page) large beside Zoom Mode, with Page Width large too
(a lone small button breaks the two-row grid). These large buttons keep their labels at every width, as Paste
does, so the group no longer shows bare icons at 1485 px; its small buttons stay bare at the small state, as in
the reference suite. Box ids and commands are unchanged, so KeyTips and tooltips apply as before.

